title: A Comrade in Prison
subtitle: One of the party's leaders is behind bars.
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and sys_prisoners_timer <= 0 and comrades_in_prison >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.sys_prisoners_timer = 3;
Q.month_actions += 1;
var pr = Q.comrades.filter(function (c) { return c.status == 'prison'; });
var c = pr[Math.floor(Math.random() * pr.length)];
Q.sys_prisoner = c.id;
Q.sys_prisoner_name = c.name;
Q.sys_prisoner_role = c.role;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: movement

= A Comrade in Prison

**[+ sys_prisoner_name +]** ([+ sys_prisoner_role +]) is in prison. The letters that get out are cheerful and heavily censored. The party needs [+ sys_prisoner_name +] outside, and so does the family.

- @campaign: Campaign for the release.
- @escape: Organise an escape.
- @exchange: Ask Moscow to arrange an exchange.
- @easy_discard

@campaign
subtitle: Worker support grows. The campaign may win the release.
on-arrival: {!
Q.worker_support += 2;
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.4 + Q.worker_support / 200) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.free(Q.sys_prisoner);
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
}
!}

Meetings in every district, petitions in the factories, questions in parliament. [? if sys_outcome = 1 : The court finds a reason to release [+ sys_prisoner_name +] early. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : The prison stays shut, but the whole country knows the name. ?]

@escape
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Bold, and the police will take revenge if it fails.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.6) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.free(Q.sys_prisoner, {news: Q.sys_prisoner_name + ' escapes from prison'});
    Q.repression += 3;
    Q.offensive_satisfaction += 3;
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    Q.repression += 4;
    var c = RG.comrade(Q.sys_prisoner);
    if (c && c.until > 0) { c.until += 3; }
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : A sympathetic warder, a forged release order and a car waiting at the corner: [+ sys_prisoner_name +] is out, and underground. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : The warder we trusted talks. The attempt fails, and the sentence is longer for it. ?]

@exchange
subtitle: Moscow can trade prisoners with Berlin. The comrade goes into exile, and we owe Moscow.
view-if: comintern_member = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence -= 5;
RG.ecci('all', -2);
if (Math.random() < 0.7) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.exile(Q.sys_prisoner, {news: Q.sys_prisoner_name + ' exchanged and sent to Moscow'});
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : Soviet diplomats trade [+ sys_prisoner_name +] for two German officers held in Russia. The comrade is free, in Moscow, and a long way from the German party. ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : Berlin refuses the exchange. ?]
